WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:54.890
<b>For Whom the Bell Tolls</b>

38
00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:56.850
Wait! He just...

39
00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.270
He just broke
Captain Kuro's "cat claw".

40
00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:02.350
[KURO grunting]

41
00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.150
[LUFFY] That leaves only five
more of those weird swords.

42
00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:07.020
[LUFFY chuckles]

43
00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:11.070
[PIRATE A] Don't worry, guys!
He can still fight plenty!

44
00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:13.070
[PIRATE G] Yeah!
He still has that other claw!

45
00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:16.660
You can do it! Rip that guy
to shreds, Captain Kuro!

46
00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.450
[PIRATE Z] Don't use
that name anymore.

47
00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.830
He doesn't like it, remember?

48
00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:23.540
I think in this village his name
is Klaha... something.

49
00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.670
Klaha-something?

50
00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.040
something! Get him good!

51
00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.380
[KURO] Shut your mouths! All of you!

52
00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:44.060
Come out you brats!
I know you're hiding!

53
00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.940
Give yourselves up!

54
00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:52.820
Come over here, and we'll take
you to her! Just don't kill us!

55
00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:58.200
Do you think I'm stupid?
I won't fall for that...

56
00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.990
You silly rug rats.

57
00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:01.870
[ONION grunts]

58
00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:04.040
[JANGO] Oh, dammit...

59
00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.040
We got him...! Now!

60
00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.250
[ONION yells]

61
00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.210
[screams]

62
00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.300
[ONION] Pepper Attack!

63
00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.470
[JANGO sneezes]

64
00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.280
Ow!

65
00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.040
[BOYS] End of the line, hypnotist!

66
00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:47.750
[JANGO] Huh?

67
00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.080
[PEPPER, CARROT yell]

68
00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.710
[BOYS groan]

69
00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:57.340
[JANGO] Looks like you bit off
a little more than you could chew.

70
00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.930
[PEPPER] No! We failed!

71
00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:04.970
[JANGO] Real pirates don't take kindly
to being mocked by the likes of you!

72
00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.270
[BOTH] Onion!

73
00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:13.480
[JANGO] You pretend pirates sure
got in over your heads, didn't you?

74
00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.400
[CARROT] Uh!

75
00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.320
[PEPPER] Uh!

76
00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.530
Rich girl, I know you're here!
Listen! Unless you show yourself

77
00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:23.080
I'll execute these three little lambs...

78
00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:26.870
And I will make sure to do it
in a most painful fashion!

79
00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.750
Do not doubt
my skill at such a task!

80
00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.340
There you are.

81
00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.890
[PEPPER] Miss Kaya!
Run for your life!

82
00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:46.350
– Hey!
– Yeah. That's them all right.

83
00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:47.770
[ZORO] They're
the other way!

84
00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:53.190
[KURO] Soon enough I'll deal with you
in the only appropriate manner...

85
00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.780
Extermination! I'll also kill
that fool Jango!

86
00:04:57.780 --> 00:05:00.610
But, why kill us, Captain?!

87
00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.740
C'mon, please don't
joke around like that, Captain Kuro!

88
00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.700
[PIRATE O] It's still not too late
for us to attack the village, right?

89
00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.500
[PIRATE Z] Yeah!

90
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.540
And if Captain Jango gets
her to write her will,

91
00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.670
then your plan
should still work perfectly!

92
00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:17.000
This plan is no longer
any of your concern.

93
00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:21.050
When all of you are dead, this village
will know who to blame for this atrocity.

94
00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.050
[PIRATES gasp]

95
00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:26.100
[KURO] I never intended
to let any of you mongrels

96
00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:28.390
leave this village alive.

97
00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:34.230
No one... No one who knows my true identity
can be allowed to live to tell about it.

98
00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.570
No way.

99
00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:40.070
You had already planned to kill every
last one of us from the very beginning.

100
00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:44.030
[KURO chuckles] That's right.

101
00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:47.830
Three years ago I planned
to erase Captain Kuro,

102
00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:52.080
and every last person
who ever knew him.

103
00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.580
It's all part
of my plan! [chuckles]

104
00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.800
[LUFFY] You guys are dumb.

105
00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:01.050
You're the most uncool pirates I know.

106
00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.890
Huh. We're "uncool", huh?

107
00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.220
Pirates are nothing more
than savages,

108
00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:09.430
incapable of rising
above their animal nature.

109
00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.850
Without my plans, what could
they possibly accomplish?

110
00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:17.570
A crew is nothing to me. They
are simply a means to an end.

111
00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:21.110
Crewmembers are just pawns
in the Captain's game.

112
00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.530
Whether my men live or die
is up to me and me alone.

113
00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:27.030
If I tell them to fight,
they will fight,

114
00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.830
and if I order them to die,
they had better do it.

115
00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.750
They know the punishment
for disobedience.

116
00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:36.880
[KURO] This is
how pirates are!

117
00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:40.090
Don't you dare
talk down to me, boy!

118
00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:44.050
[PIRATES murmur]

119
00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.930
[KURO growls]

120
00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.140
[LUFFY] You know, no matter
how many hundreds,

121
00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:51.430
or thousands of men follow
you as their Captain.

122
00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:55.230
You will never be
as good as Usopp!

123
00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.230
[PIRATES gasp]

124
00:06:57.230 --> 00:07:03.690
You fool. Are you saying that I am
inferior to a kid pretending to be a pirate?

125
00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.700
That's right!

126
00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:09.700
[laughs] Well, aren't you
funny?! Don't get all cocky

127
00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:13.540
just because you snapped off
one of my cat claws!

128
00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:17.630
How exactly is he better
than me?! Let's hear it!

129
00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:24.090
'Cause he's got heart.

130
00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.840
[KURO] He's got what?

131
00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:30.600
[LUFFY] A guy like you doesn't know
what a true pirate is!

132
00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.720
[PIRATES stammer]

133
00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:38.850
[PIRATE A] Impossible!

134
00:07:43.990 --> 00:07:47.450
[PIRATE I] He kept up
with the pussyfoot maneuver!

135
00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.790
[KURO] How insulting.

136
00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:59.750
[KURO] It would appear that you need
a lesson in what real pirates are like.

137
00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:03.380
It's not pleasant.

138
00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:05.920
Your first lesson will be
about terror.

139
00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:10.390
A lesson I learned well
as I stared down death!

140
00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:17.230
Hey! Should he be
in that stance?!

141
00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.230
No, this is bad!

142
00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.650
[PIRATE X] Why's he using
that technique?!

143
00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.480
[PIRATE DD] He's
only fighting one guy.

144
00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:27.950
There's no reason to use
the Out of the Back Attack!

145
00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.240
[PIRATE X] This isn't
a good spot for us!

146
00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.530
I mean, he could get us too!

147
00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.870
[PIRATE M] Yeah. He did say
he was gonna kill us all earlier.

148
00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:36.950
[PIRATE DD] Please, Captain Kuro!
Anything but that technique!

149
00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:40.250
[PIRATE G] We'll do
anything, Captain!

150
00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:43.000
[PIRATE X] Please,
Captain Kuro!

151
00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.800
What's the big deal? He's
just wobbling back and forth.

152
00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:52.300
[KURO] Out
of the Back Attack!

153
00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:03.520
[NAMI grunts]
What a small haul!

154
00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:08.440
You know I really thought
they'd have more treasure than this!

155
00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.530
Let's see if the boys
have finished this fight yet.

156
00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:17.700
Huh? What...? Everyone
has stopped... Is it over?

157
00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.170
[PIRATE EE screams]

158
00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:29.050
[LUFFY gasps]

159
00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:31.180
What's he doing over there?!

160
00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:35.010
[PIRATES screaming]

161
00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.180
[LUFFY gasps] That guy's everywhere!

162
00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.730
[PIRATES groaning]

163
00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:46.070
Don't do this, Captain!
Please stop!

164
00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:47.190
We're dead!

165
00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.240
We can't reason with him
now that he's started!

166
00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:53.910
His sidestep maneuver is so fast
not even he knows what he's cutting!

167
00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.580
But how could he have killed
so many of us without even...

168
00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:58.950
– [groans]
– No!

169
00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.040
[NAMI] What's
happening out there?!

170
00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.550
People are just
getting cut to ribbons!

171
00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:17.010
[PIRATES screaming, groaning]

172
00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.440
[LUFFY] Show yourself...

173
00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.770
Butler!

174
00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:43.790
Don't you have any honor?!
Those men are your friends!

175
00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.540
Luffy...

176
00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:59.970
[LUFFY groans]

177
00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:08.860
[LUFFY yells]

178
00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.780
[LUFFY panting] I found you.

179
00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.910
You bastard.

180
00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:20.080
You should've accepted
your fate like a good boy...

181
00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:22.040
Now look what you've done!

182
00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:26.920
Thanks to you, my little pawns
are still alive, and in misery.

183
00:11:26.920 --> 00:11:31.050
It would have been better
to just let them die in the attack.

184
00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:36.680
[KURO] So, now what? Do
you have something to say?

185
00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.430
[LUFFY] Yeah.

186
00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.180
No matter what
happens to me...

187
00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.140
I will never be like you...

188
00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:46.350
[KURO] Not "will".

189
00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.230
Someone like you...

190
00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.150
can't be like me.

191
00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:55.820
[KURO] You see...

192
00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.820
You are going
to die here today.

193
00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.330
There's no need for that.

194
00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:06.790
Please, leave the children
be. I'll write the will.

195
00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:12.000
He's gonna kill you as soon
as you write that will!

196
00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.000
No, Kaya!

197
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:15.840
Silly girl. Don't you know
you can't bargain with me?

198
00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:19.550
Captain Kuro specifically instructed
me to get rid of everyone.

199
00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.800
[KAYA] No!

200
00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.350
[BOYS whimper]

201
00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:28.270
[JANGO] Wha...?!

202
00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:31.190
If you don't do exactly as I say
then you won't get to kill me,

203
00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:33.980
and, I won't write my will!

204
00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.940
[JANGO] Hold on! Hold on!

205
00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.320
Just calm down!
Don't be so hasty!

206
00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:40.860
I absolutely have to get
you to write that will!

207
00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.240
Stop! Kaya!

208
00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:48.040
Alright! Fine, I'll let
the little brats go...

209
00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:51.960
But, in their condition, they won't
be making too quick of a getaway.

210
00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.960
[CARROT whimpers]

211
00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.260
[JANGO] Don't forget
to sign your name.

212
00:12:57.260 --> 00:12:58.800
[KAYA] I know.

213
00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:05.390
[JANGO chuckles] "I leave
my entire fortune to my butler,

214
00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:07.850
Klahadore," Yes...

215
00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:12.730
Very good! This is your will,
all right! Excellent work!

216
00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:14.610
Now remember,
we had a deal.

217
00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.690
You promised me
you wouldn't kill them.

218
00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:23.700
Just relax. I know I may not look like
it, but I'm regarded as an honest man.

219
00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:25.330
[KAYA whimpering]

220
00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.670
Over there!

221
00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:38.010
– [ZORO] Okay! I'll be back!
– [USOPP] What the...!

222
00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.510
That's enough of that,
hypno-freak! Let the girl go!

223
00:13:40.510 --> 00:13:43.590
[JANGO] Dammit!
Looks like I was followed!

224
00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.390
[KAYA groaning]

225
00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:47.810
[ALL gasp]

226
00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:54.060
I guess I'd better finish off
the rich girl quickly then.

227
00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:01.030
That was simply a warm up.

228
00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:02.070
Huh?

229
00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:05.910
[KURO] The real fight
begins now.

230
00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:08.330
Soon I will be feasting
on your fear.

231
00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:11.710
Complimented by the sweet
wine of your agony.

232
00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:12.750
Uh!

233
00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.090
Now!

234
00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.090
[KURO] Out
of the Back Attack!

235
00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:29.890
[LUFFY grunts]

236
00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:31.810
[PIRATES murmur]

237
00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:37.190
[KURO groaning]

238
00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:38.980
Nice try. You jerk!

239
00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.240
[KURO] Damn you!
Get away from me!

240
00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:44.070
Wow, butler-man! Right now
your life really sucks.

241
00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.530
Your plan of three years is
a complete and total failure.

242
00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.410
[KURO] Let go!

243
00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:50.160
Hey, look! That weird kid
caught Captain Kuro!

244
00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.210
I don't believe it!
If that goofy kid manages to beat him,

245
00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:56.170
then that means Captain Kuro
won't be able to slaughter us, right?!

246
00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:58.130
[KAYA whimpers]

247
00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.800
It's time to die!

248
00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:02.510
– [PEPPER] Oh no, you don't!
– [KAYA] Uh?!

249
00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:03.550
[PEPPER, ONION, CARROT yell]

250
00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:05.760
[JANGO] Ow!

251
00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.260
Stupid, snot-nosed brats!

252
00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.930
[PEPPER, ONION, CARROT] Ah!

253
00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:15.850
It looks like you're one
step too late, Swordsman!

254
00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.400
[ZORO] Wouldn't say that!

255
00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:21.940
Excellent!

256
00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:25.200
That branch was getting
in the way of my shot!

257
00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.320
What?!

258
00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:27.490
Help me, Usopp!

259
00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.370
[ALL] Do it, Captain!

260
00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.300
[USOPP]
Eat this, hypnotist!

261
00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:34.710
Yeah! Get 'em
you crazy, rubber guy!

262
00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.370
You're goin' down,
you mean bastard!

263
00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:37.370
[LUFFY gasps]

264
00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.380
[KURO] Get off me!

265
00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:39.290
[LUFFY grunts]

266
00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:41.170
Just shut up!

267
00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:44.210
You have no right
to cheer me on!

268
00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.470
[KURO groaning] Let go of me!

269
00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.430
[LUFFY] Gum-Gum...!

270
00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:50.180
[KURO groaning]

271
00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:51.970
Now! Time for the exploding star!

272
00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:55.270
– [JANGO groaning]
– [KAYA screams]

273
00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.940
– [KURO] You insect!
– [LUFFY] Bell!

274
00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:00.110
– My plan will absolutely
– Bell!

275
00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:03.360
– not be disrupted!
– Bell!

276
00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:21.060
As a kid I had a dream of a dazzling treasure

277
00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:28.080
I had a map in my head that I knew would lead me

278
00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:35.180
Charted a course all on my own so nobody would beat me

279
00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:42.440
The promised land was in my hand drew a line in the sand

280
00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.820
Look where I am

281
00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:56.230
My one ambitions slipping right through my hands

282
00:16:56.570 --> 00:17:03.500
But if the world ever changes Ill call out your name

283
00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:10.580
We could return to a time when our lives were still the same

284
00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:17.710
Take me to the place where memories remain

285
00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:23.580
Please dont ever let them fade
